WEBVTT

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.420
Don't worry.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.570
That's right!

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.890
Yumi-chin will handle everything else.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.430
<i>No...</i>

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.170
<i>That's not what I meant!</i>

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:16.910
<i>To Yumi-chan, that girl is...</i>

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.590
<i>No,</i>

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:20.610
<i>it's the same for all of you!</i>

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.800
I understand the purpose
of the Shinobi Masters.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.420
But...

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:33.670
I retain my objections to your
extreme concept of justice.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.620
Then what will you do?

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:40.530
Win this battle,

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:44.190
and show you a new type
of justice for shinobi.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:48.940
"The justice of the moon," was it?

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:54.480
A black... fan?

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:59.950
Let us begin.

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:16.970
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:17.720
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:18.430
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:18.760
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.930
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.930
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:39.050
Kurokage-chan's beliefs...

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:42.780
You know about Kurokage?

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:43.690
Yup!

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:47.350
Asuka's grandpa was Hanzo's partner, right?

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:50.340
I hear a lot of rumors, but...

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:52.540
What were they really like?

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:55.010
Well, pretty much,

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:56.940
they were really stupid.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.170
Huh?

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:02.600
But you could also say that
they were very pure.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.520
Like clear water...

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:08.100
Never knowing impurity...

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:22.460
Kurokage!

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.970
Mission complete, eh?

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:26.510
Yeah.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:31.210
How about a drink after the debriefing?

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:34.420
Don't try to be my friend, Hanzo.

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.720
I've never thought of you as a friend.

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:39.490
I see.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:41.700
That's right, we're rivals.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.950
But if you ask me,

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.210
rivals are still friends.

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:47.860
Whatever you say.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.330
Okay, I'll be waiting!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.340
<b>Eatery</b>

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.340
<b>Eatery      Drinks</b>

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.340
<b>Kirari Beer</b>

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.340
<b>Pub</b>

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.130
Gimme another, bartender!

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.350
Comin' right up!

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.140
You're looking good tonight.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.790
Excuse me.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.010
Yume?

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.200
I asked her to come.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.820
Here, sit down.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.270
Thank you.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.200
What do you want?

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:34.970
I'll have the same thing, I guess.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.780
Oh, you like that stuff, huh?

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:37.770
Get her something, bartender.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.620
Okay, cheers!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:41.730
Cheers?

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:46.170
You've started dating, haven't you?

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:51.050
Don't underestimate the
intelligence-gathering abilities of a shinobi.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:52.940
Sorry.

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.560
You told him?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.190
It's fine.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:59.310
You need to have your
fun and drinks when you can.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:01.620
You're right.

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:05.200
Okay, cheers!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:06.880
We need more people in here!

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.830
Hey, put her over there!

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.340
We're full!

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:12.100
Just find her a place to lie down!

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.510
They fell into a trap set by evil ninjas.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:22.730
Hey!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.270
If they get you, get them back.

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:30.020
I'll make them fall into
an even crueler trap.

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:33.960
You can't repay dirty tricks
with more dirty tricks.

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:35.960
I don't care what anyone says.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.750
I'm going to wipe out all evil ninjas!

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:42.860
Can you really call fighting
out of rage and hatred "justice"?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.690
Don't follow the wrong path.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:47.130
If justice goes too far, it becomes evil!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:52.110
Justice is always justice,
no matter how far you go!

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:01.630
Kurokage's parents
were talented shinobi.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.020
But they were captured
by evil ninjas, and...

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.140
Yes, he told me.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:12.320
They were tortured, then killed.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:17.200
I understand why he hates evil ninjas
 even more than most people do.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.860
And that's why I'm worried.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.030
Who are you?

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.840
You...

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:37.870
...are evil!

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.130
Are you a good ninja?

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:52.340
Do you think you
can get away with this?

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:05.040
Hey,

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.780
that black weapon...

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.380
Doesn't it look like Yumi-chan's fan?

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:10.530
Yeah.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:15.530
Yumi-chin got her fan from
Kurokage-sama, right?

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:18.330
It's not over.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:21.260
We still have Fubuki-sama!

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:22.370
We do.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:47.560
It seems Fubuki's begun to fight.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:51.070
How is a youma talking like a person?

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:56.080
There were reports of youma saying
things that sounded like words, but...

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.450
Miyabi...

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.330
This youma's on a whole other level.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.990
It has the same intelligence as a human.

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:05.480
As a human?

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.590
A youma does?

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:10.340
That youma smells like a human.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.840
Who are you?

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:16.850
Who can say, really?

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.130
If you're a shinobi,

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:21.850
why not take the answer
from me by force?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:26.850
Of course, you'll all die if you try.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:29.790
I've never felt such an intense
murderous aura.

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:32.360
This seems bad.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:35.540
I'm gonna piss myself!

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:38.940
If you won't come to me, I'll go to you.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:57.880
Secret Ninja Art: Black Ice!

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:07.740
She's strong.

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.180
Yumi-chin...

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:12.690
What's wrong? Is that all you've got?

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:15.770
No!

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:18.200
Then...

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.200
I will end it.

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:48.730
What is this?

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.160
Ultimate Secret Ninja Art:

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.530
Ice Queen!

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:09.750
This technique carries with it
Grandfather Kurokage's hopes...

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:11.250
And it will end this!

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:14.590
I've been banished?

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:18.010
You attacked evil ninjas when
you weren't on a mission.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.830
This is your punishment.

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:23.490
As of this moment, you are
relieved of all duties.

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:26.510
Evil ninjas are the
enemies of good ninjas.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:31.280
Whether I'm on a mission or not,
what's wrong with destroying them?

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.930
Your ignorance comes
from your youth, perhaps.

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:37.530
You should not speak of what a shinobi
should do unless you know of the youma.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:40.780
Ignorance is truly a sin.

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:42.140
Youma?

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:43.600
What are you talking about?

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:47.950
There are certain important members
of the world of shinobi who are gray,

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:50.290
neither good nor evil.

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:54.110
Sometimes good and evil
must help one another.

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:57.800
The world of the shinobi is connected.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:01.400
White and black sometimes
mingle to form grey.

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:04.580
And those were the shinobi
that you attacked.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:07.810
What are you talking about?

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:11.720
We have a great deal of admiration
for your power as a shinobi.

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:16.020
If you swear to understand the world
of the shinobi and obey our orders...

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:18.570
Shut up!

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.280
Everything but justice is evil,

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.820
and must be hunted!

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:26.330
If you refuse to accept your punishment,

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:29.720
we will punish Hanzo and Yume, too.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:33.240
We can always come up with
something to convict them.

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:34.830
You bastards...

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:38.280
Evil! Evil! Evil!

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:42.500
Yume and Hanzo have
nothing to do with this!

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:45.080
Don't touch them!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.850
I know you're mad.

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.380
But if you ask me...

00:11:55.380 --> 00:12:00.900
The act of trying to eliminate
evil is evil, too.

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:06.610
Hanzo, are you calling me evil?

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:08.490
My parents were killed,

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:10.130
my friends were killed.

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:13.660
And I'm supposed to do nothing?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:20.130
All humans have evil within them.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:24.640
What I'm saying is that
you can't deny all of that!

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:31.410
Then I'll make a world
of just good, with no evil.

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:33.490
That's impossible!

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:34.890
Why won't you understand?

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.340
I can!

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:38.480
It's impossible! I'll bet anything!

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:46.530
Hanzo,

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:50.510
I'll win our bet!

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:55.960
I'll make a world of pure good.

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.260
Yume...

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:05.290
Kurokage!

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:09.980
Don't forget the sword and shield.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:14.100
I know you'll understand its meaning.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:31.370
After he parted ways with the good ninjas,

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:35.130
he began to hunt evil ninjas on his own.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:36.700
Of course,

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:39.380
this wasn't something
that could be allowed.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:44.820
Both good and evil ninjas
 came after his life.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.890
Hey, Yume.

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:56.580
You look well.

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.020
Yes.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:05.860
Excuse me.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:10.660
<b>Extra-Healthy Baby Formula</b>

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:10.660
Oh, this is for you.

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:12.590
Thanks for always helping.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:15.150
I'm the one who should apologize.

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:17.660
This is all I can do.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.410
Is there any word from Kurokage?

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:22.850
No...

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.090
I see.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:26.930
Hanzo-san,

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:32.810
I believe that he's still alive
out there somewhere.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.430
Yeah,

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.950
I think so, too.

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:41.810
I'm going to raise these
kids to be shinobi.

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:47.510
He may live his life in a foolish way,

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:49.190
but he's not wrong.

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:53.510
They should be proud of their father.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.050
Yeah.

00:14:57.050 --> 00:14:58.700
You're right.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:00.900
I'm sure of it.

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:56.070
He was a talented shinobi,

00:15:56.070 --> 00:16:00.370
but because he was Kurokage's son,
he always got the hardest missions.

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:02.300
It's a sad thing...

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.330
Even his wife passed away.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.080
What about the daughter?

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:08.530
I heard she has no relatives now.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:12.540
My son and daughter-in-law,

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:16.730
and they died without
me ever seeing them.

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:20.110
So this is the result of the path I chose?

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:45.560
Are your parents gone?

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:47.240
Yes.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.820
What will you do now?

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.420
I don't know.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:59.500
I just know I want to be a
shinobi like my parents.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:02.050
I see.

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.860
You're sad, aren't you?

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:12.590
Even if you don't let it show, I can tell.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.930
I've lived my life the same way,

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:19.400
hiding my sorrow with anger.

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:22.810
I am your grandfather.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:26.830
Not that I expect you to believe me.

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:35.110
My father and grandmother told me
my grandfather has a big scar on his cheek.

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:41.450
They always said
he was a great shinobi.

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:44.300
When they talked about him,

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:47.960
they both looked so proud,

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:51.340
but also kind of sad.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:57.630
Why are you crying?

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:03.140
I don't know myself.

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:05.840
Yumi...

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:10.400
Will you come with me?

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.210
Yes.

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:28.670
Yumi, your hands are so warm.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:33.100
So are yours, Grandfather Kurokage.

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:34.620
Are they?

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.800
Fubuki-sama!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.520
The battle is over.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.400
Admit your defeat.

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.850
What's so funny?

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:57.370
You think you've already won.

00:18:57.370 --> 00:19:01.310
When the real fight is just beginning.

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:05.080
Shinobi Transformation.

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:23.090
Now come get me.

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:29.560
Is that your trump card?

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.560
How boring!

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:34.610
Oh no,

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.570
she's being pushed back!

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:38.350
That transformation
has a time limit, right?

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:39.820
This is bad!

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.280
Yumi-chin needs to end the fight now!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:54.930
Yumi-chan!

00:19:58.640 --> 00:19:59.950
No...

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:00.960
Impossible...

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:03.850
Yumi-chin lost?

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.760
I remember!

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:14.100
You're—

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:16.520
Yumi,

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:20.020
she's going to be living
with us from now on.

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:22.990
Think of her as an older sister,
and be her friend.

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:26.080
That's right.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:30.210
I lived with you when you were young.

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:32.290
With Grandfather Kurokage.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:37.700
That's before he took us in, right?

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:38.620
Yeah.

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:41.800
We never met anyone like that.

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:45.290
You and I are like sisters.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:48.800
But we follow very different paths.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:51.760
There's too much you don't know.

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:55.870
That's why you can talk about
"the justice of the moon."

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:03.780
I now declare war on all shinobi!

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:06.070
So that's her next move.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.200
Declare war?

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:10.350
Fubuki-sama...

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:12.290
What are you talking about?

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:15.940
The justice of the shinobi
is filled with hypocrisy!

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:19.800
And it can no longer be allowed to exist!

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:24.540
Everyone!

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:28.300
Homura-san! Miyabi-san!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:30.810
Be careful! It's a youma!

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.190
A youma?

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:44.080
Why?

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:48.210
I'll destroy both good and evil shinobi...

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:51.700
With my blade of revenge.

00:21:52.340 --> 00:21:55.490
And with the youma!

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:28.680
The reason is obvious!

00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:32.050
Because youma are
threats to all humanity!

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:35.810
The door to another world is open.

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:39.310
Now it's time to begin!
